{"id":"c9f50803c6dbd04e","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-internal-logic.md","title":"内部逻辑","display":"df-internal-logic — 内部逻辑","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-internal-logic","aliases":["91-df-internal-logic"],"display":"df-internal-logic — 内部逻辑","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-internal-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-internal-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-internal-logic — 内部逻辑"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-internal-logic-—-内部逻辑-$\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Int}}$\">df-internal-logic — 内部逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Int}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Int}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (含真理谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的对象理论，例如 KF)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (作用于句子编码数字名的真理谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\Delta\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Int}}^S\\varphi\n\\coloneqq\nS\\vdash\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{\\delta\\in\\Delta}T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner})\n\\rightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\right),\n\\quad\n\\Delta\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\n\\quad\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\Delta\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Int}}^S\\varphi\n\\coloneqq\nS\\vdash\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{\\delta\\in\\Delta}T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner})\n\\rightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\right),\n\\quad\n\\Delta\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\n\\quad\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Int}}^S\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Int}}^S\\)</span>：把前提与结论都置于真理谓词作用域内的后承关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(S\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>：对象理论的普通可证关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span>句子集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：内部逻辑是指在真理理论内部可以进行的逻辑推理。在KF理论中，内部逻辑有以下特征：\n其强弱由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的真理公理决定。例如组合合取公理可支持相应的内部合取规则；正内省则需要单独的迭代真理公理。两者都不是“内部逻辑”这个定义自动保证的。</p>\n<p>与外部逻辑的区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内部逻辑</strong>：使用真理谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>进行的推理（在理论内部）</li>\n<li><strong>外部逻辑</strong>：从理论外部观察真理集的推理（元理论层面）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>KF 的对象层推理通常仍采用经典逻辑。可能呈现非经典行为的是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Int}}^{\\mathrm{KF}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Int}}^{\\mathrm{KF}}\\)</span> 这种经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 内化后的后承关系，而不是 KF 的背景演绎逻辑本身。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-internal-logic-—-内部逻辑-$\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Int}}$","text":"df-internal-logic — 内部逻辑 $\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Int}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T$ (扩展语言, see [[91-df-language-with-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Log}_{\\mathrm{Int}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\Delta\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Int}}^S\\varphi\n\\coloneqq\nS\\vdash\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{\\delta\\in\\Delta}T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner})\n\\rightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\right),\n\\quad\n\\Delta\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\n\\quad\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Int}}^S","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Int}}^{\\mathrm{KF}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1849,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d8969c7b834f5a6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f28d9b3f22314622","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[